  <head>Field work in Sudan – February/March 2023:</head>
  <p>Master student Stanley went on his first field trip to Sudan to
  study the dialect of the Rashayda tribe. He was welcomed and hosted by
  the University of Shendi and had the chance to not only collect
  precious data about the Rashaydas’ dialect but also to dive into the
  local culture of Sudan.</p>
</div>

